'''Nyanko Defense Force''' (にゃんこ防衛軍), also known as '''Battle Cats Galaxy'''<sup>[https://twitter.com/gameclosure/status/1024780788749938688 source]</sup>, was a [https://lqg.game.line.me/ LINE QUICK GAME]. Developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] and [https://www.gameclosure.com/ Game Closure]. It was launched on July 28th, 2018. LINE ended support for this game as of October 30th, 2020, meaning that it can no longer be played.

